.TH DANBY-SHIPMOTION 1
.SH NAME
danby-shipmotion \- forced roll and pitch at sea
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/shipmotion
.SH MODEL
Roll and pitch are separate damped, forced angular oscillators with adjustable
hydrostatic stiffness and wave frequencies.  Their phase offset makes combined
sea motion visible without conflating the two axes.
.SH DISPLAY
Front and side hull projections show roll and pitch; both angles are plotted
against time.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/shipmotion.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
